title: DNVP Rally
new-page: true

= DNVP's Turn

@rally
title: Rally
view-if: {!
    if (Q.labor_minister_party == "DNVP" && Q.labor_affairs_post_timer == 0 && Q.strike_term_seen_post_timer == 0) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.rfb_force > 25 && !Q.rfb_banned && !Q.return_to_normalcy) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.dnvp_rally_post_timer > 0) {
        return true;
    } else {
        return false;
    }
!}

The DNVP will hold a rally

- @class_collaboration
- @rally_volkism
- @rally_nationalism
- @rally_democracy
- @rally_lautenbach
- @rally_local

@rfb_disrupt
title: The Communist RFB has disrupted the DNVP rally!
view-if: {!
    if (Q.labor_minister_party == "DNVP" && Q.labor_affairs_timer == 0 && Q.strike_term_seen == 0) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.rfb_force > 25 && !Q.rfb_banned && !Q.return_to_normalcy && Q.dnvp_rally_post_timer > 0) {
        return true;
    } else {
        return false;
    }
!}

The Communist RFB has disrupted the DNVP rally!

- @rally_police
- @stahlhelm_protect
- @both_protect

@rally_police
title: The DNVP have called the police to protect their rally
view-if: {!
    if (Q.prussia_leader == "Braun" || Q.prussia_leader == "Rosenfeld" || !Q.russian_police_sh_training) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.dnvp_authoritarian_strength + Q.dnvp_agrarian_strength < Q.dnvp_volkskonservativ_strength + Q.dnvp_christian_social_strength) {
        return true;
    } else {
        return false;
    }
!}

The DNVP have called the police to protect their rally

go-to: rally_police_win if police_protect_success_dnvp >= 0; rally_police_lose if police_protect_success_dnvp < 0

@rally_police_win
title: The police have prevailed!

The police successfully protected the DNVP's rally, so it can go ahead as usual.

- @class_collaboration
- @rally_volkism
- @rally_nationalism
- @rally_democracy
- @rally_lautenbach
- @rally_local

@rally_police_lose
title: The police were unable or unwilling to hold back the RFB.

The RFB have won this show of strength.

@stahlhelm_protect
title: The Stahlhelm are sent to protect the rally.
view-if: {!
    if (Q.prussia_leader == "Braun" || Q.prussia_leader == "Rosenfeld" || !Q.prussian_police_sh_training) {
        if (Q.dnvp_authoritarian_strength + Q.dnvp_agrarian_strength > Q.dnvp_volkskonservativ_strength + Q.dnvp_christian_social_strength) {
            return true;
        } else {
            return false;
        }
    } else {
        return false;
    }
!}
go-to: stahlhelm_protect_win if stahlhelm_success >= 0; stahlhelm_protect_lose if stahlhelm_success < 0

@stahlhelm_protect_win

The Stahlhelm have successfully protected the DNVP rally against the RFB. Their meeting can go ahead as usual.

- @class_collaboration
- @rally_volkism
- @rally_nationalism
- @rally_democracy
- @rally_lautenbach
- @rally_local

@stahlhelm_protect_lose
on-arrival: workers_kpd += 3; stahlhelm_strength -= 50

The Stahlhelm was not able to hold back the RFB. The Communists have won this show of strength.

@both_protect
title: The Stahlhelm and Prussian police are sent to protect the rally.
view-if: prussia_leader != "Braun" and prussia_leader != "Rosenfeld" and prussian_police_sh_training
go-to: both_protect_win if stahlhelm_success >= 0; both_protect_lose if stahlhelm_success < 0

@both_protect_win

The police and Stahlhelm have successfully protected the DNVP rally against the RFB. The DNVP's meeting can go ahead as usual.

- @class_collaboration
- @rally_volkism
- @rally_nationalism
- @rally_democracy
- @rally_lautenbach
- @rally_local

@both_protect_lose
on-arrival: workers_kpd += 3; stahlhelm_strength -= 50

The police and Stahlhelm were not able to hold back the RFB. The Communists have won this show of strength.

@class_collaboration
title: The class collaboration of the proletariat with the bourgeoisie.
view-if: dnvp_leader == "Lambach" and corporatist_progress

The DNVP's mesage of class collaboration appeals to all but the class conscious. [? if corporatist_adopted: The adoption of the christian social corporatist plan has done much to revitalize worker enthusiasm.  ?] [? if corporatist_progress > 0: Their achievements in corporatism have assisted their messaging. ?]

@rally_volkism
title: Volkism - German Nationalism, Antisemitism, Patriarchy, Xenophobia, and Homophobia
view-if: dnvp_leader == "Hugenberg" or dnvp_leader == "Schiele"

The DNVP's speakers blames the ills of society on foreigners and the marginaqlized [? if black_thursday_seen and not return_to_normalcy: , a message popular among the desperate masses, who believe themselves betrayed by the establishment parties ?]

@rally_nationalism
title: Supporting rearmament, nationalism, and an end to reparations
view-if: {!
    if (Q.dnvp_leader == "Triumvirate" || Q.dnvp_leader == "Westarp") {
        return true;
    } else if (Q.dnvp_leader == "Treviranus") {
        if (Q.dnvp_lautenbach_adopted && !Q.return_to_normalcy && (Q.lautenbach_adopted >= Q.dnvp_lautenbach_rally || !Q.dnvp_in_government)) {
            return false;
        } else {
            return true;
        }
    } else {
        return false;
    }
!}

The DNVP's speakers praise the military establishment and call for rearmament.

[? if dnvp_nationalism >= 3 : With nationalism increasingly popular within their party, the rally's speakers call for the cessation of reparations and reuinifaction of Germany ?]

@rally_democracy
title: Expanding our nascent democracy and defending it against <span style="color: #808080;">dictatorship</span> and <span style="color: #7A3C00;">fascism</span>.
view-if: dnvp_leader == "Hergt" or dnvp_leader == "Keudell"

The DNVP will defend the <span style="color: #000000;">rep</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">ubl</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">ican</span> system and rail against the <span style="color: #808080;">monarchists</span> and <span style="color: #A00500;">communists</span> who threaten it.

[? if dnvp_democratization < 3 : Talk of democracy does not excite the workers, middle classes, and rural folk as much as more practical issues. ?]
[? if dnvp_democratization >= 3 : Since they have consistently made democratization a theme of their campaigns, the workers, middle classes, and rural folk are enthusiastic about their message. ?]

@rally_lautenbach
title: Support the Lautenbach plan!
view-if: {!
    if (Q.dnvp_leader == "Treviranus" || Q.dnvp_leader == "Lejeune-Jung") {
        if (Q.dnvp_lautenbach_adopted && !Q.return_to_normalcy && (Q.lautenbach_adopted >= Q.dnvp_lautenbach_rally || !Q.dnvp_in_government)) {
            return true;
        } else {
            return false;
        }
    } else {
        return false;
    }
!}

The Lautenbach plan has become a popular rallying cry for the DNVP. The workers and employers see it as a necessary compromise. [? if not lautenbach_adopted: However, many are still skeptical whether the plan will actually prove effective. ?]

@rally_local
title: A mixture of various local and national concerns that resonate most with the audience.
view-if: {!
    if (Q.dnvp_leader == "Lambach") {
        if (Q.corporatist_progress) {
            return false;
        } else {
            return true;
        }
    } else if (Q.dnvp_leader == "Lejeune-Jung") {
        if (Q.dnvp_lautenbach_adopted && !Q.return_to_normalcy && (Q.lautenbach_adopted >= Q.dnvp_lautenbach_rally || !Q.dnvp_in_government)) {
            return false;
        } else {
            return true;
        }
    }
!}

The DNVP's speakers have gauged the mood and are speaking to the issues that seem to most affect workers, employers, and women in this moment.
